<title>USA: Benton Oil names Whipkey CFO.</title>
<headline>Benton Oil names Whipkey CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CARPINTERIA, Calif. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Benton Oil and Gas Co said Thursday it named James Whipkey chief financial officer and senior vice president.</p>
<p>The company said that prior to joining Benton Oil,  Whipkey served as vice president of Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc in New York.</p>
<p>The company was not available for immediate comment concerning whom Whipkey is replacing.</p>
</text>
